    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814190/extras/b5f0426d0cdc3cd7e9cb9440237575fc.avif?t=1755451026\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Stop Horror Hospital - Where Fear is the Ultimate Illusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a modern hospital originally an asylum shut down for experimental therapies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Mr. Giggles and Investigators who are trying to stop an unknown contagion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One way in and One way out. However, you can roam all about the hospital area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You walked in the Front Door, so Collect his 'Toys' and you walk out the Front Door to ecsape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Giggles a former mental patient obsessed with evil clowns. He feeds on illusion, traps,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > puzzles, and torment. Investigators in hazmat suits attack you and are under his influence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the resources you need staying one step ahead of attackers while fighting your way out. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814190/extras/b5f0426d0cdc3cd7e9cb9440237575fc.avif?t=1755451026\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Stop Horror Hospital - Where Fear is the Ultimate Illusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a modern hospital originally an asylum shut down for experimental therapies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Mr. Giggles and Investigators who are trying to stop an unknown contagion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One way in and One way out. However, you can roam all about the hospital area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You walked in the Front Door, so Collect his 'Toys' and you walk out the Front Door to ecsape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mr. Giggles a former mental patient obsessed with evil clowns. He feeds on illusion, traps,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > puzzles, and torment. Investigators in hazmat suits attack you and are under his influence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the resources you need staying one step ahead of attackers while fighting your way out. </p>",
